.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-log-query - Search the logs (JSON body)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container log-query  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Search the logs (JSON body)

.PP
Same as the GET search with the parameters in the body (\fBwhere\fR as a list). Logs are what your containers write to stdout / stderr. Every query is built by the platform with your environment fixed; there is no raw query language. \fBFree package\fP: 7 days, 5 GB per month. Paid packages (30 / 90 / 365 days x 10 / 50 / 100 / 300 GB per month, prepaid hourly; \fBGET /cloud/containers/{id}/logs/plans\fR) keep logs longer. Over the monthly size there is no extra charge: the stored volume is capped at GB x days / 30, the oldest logs are deleted earlier and you get the \fBlog_quota\fR notification at 80 % and 100 %. When the environment is cancelled its logs are deleted at once. Best effort service, no compensation for lost log lines.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/containers/{id}/logs/query (operationId queryContainerLogs, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--after\fP=""
	live tail cursor (\fBtail_cursor\fR / \fBcursor\fR): lines after it, oldest first; poll every 2-3 s

.PP
\fB--before\fP=""
	page cursor (\fBnext_cursor\fR of the previous page): older lines

.PP
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB--end\fP=""
	RFC3339 end (default now)

.PP
\fB--exclude\fP=""
	line does not contain this text

.PP
\fB--filter\fP=""
	line contains this text (case-insensitive, max 200)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for log-query

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--level\fP=""
	error | warn | info | debug (level word in the line)

.PP
\fB--param-limit\fP=0
	lines (default 300, max 5000)

.PP
\fB--parse\fP=""
	json (default when \fBwhere\fR is given) | logfmt

.PP
\fB--service\fP=""
	only this service (default: all services of the environment)

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)

.PP
\fB--since-minutes\fP=0
	window ending now (default 60); limited to the package retention

.PP
\fB--start\fP=""
	RFC3339 start (instead of since_minutes); one query spans at most 31 days

.PP
\fB--where\fP=[]
	field conditions on JSON / logfmt lines, separated by \fB;\fR: \fBstatus>=500; path~/api; method=POST\fR (ops = != > >= < <= =~ ~)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--account\fP=""
